 ```
 
+For one manual Windows launch, generate a release-specific handoff after the
+exact outer installer and bundle have received full signed acceptance.
+Run this from the repository with the verified release inputs.
+
+```powershell
+python -m deploy.release_lab.trusted_acceptance_handoff prepare-install-handoff `
+  --bundle $Bundle --outer $Outer --publisher $PublisherScript --public-key $PublicKey `
+  --expected-client-sha256 $TestedWindowsClientSha256 --output $InstallAndPublishScript
+```
+
+Run the generated script in ordinary PowerShell from the Windows account
+that holds the saved administrative profile. Standard UAC elevates only the
+installation and placement of the verified approval. After reinstall or
+upgrade, the ordinary user process verifies the installed payload and invokes
+the client's existing one-shot publication. The saved default admin profile
+must already reach the publication server using its pinned SSH host key.
+The generated script is pinned to the exact tested outer installer, current
+approval, installed client and signed payload.
+
